+therefore prepares each call descriptor in $\operatorname{poly}(\log(2V))=O(V)$
+time. Each primitive reuses its fixed work tapes. Thus all exposure and
+restoration costs
+$O(Tp\,d(1+\ell^\tau))$.
 
